WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.232
Rat and Mole sat in armchairs in Toad Hall.

2
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:09.818
In the next room, Badger was talking to Toad.

3
00:00:09.819 --> 00:00:13.715
"I hope Toad is taking it well," said Mole.

4
00:00:13.716 --> 00:00:17.808
"I don’t think Toad will listen," said Rat.

5
00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:21.033
They heard Badger’s voice go quiet.

6
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:26.293
"Rat, it sounds like Toad is crying," said Mole.

7
00:00:26.294 --> 00:00:30.853
The door opened, and Badger and Toad appeared.

8
00:00:30.854 --> 00:00:36.492
Badger looked serious and Toad looked tearful.

9
00:00:36.493 --> 00:00:40.098
"Sit down, Toad," said Badger.

10
00:00:40.099 --> 00:00:44.336
Toad sat next to Rat and Mole.

11
00:00:44.337 --> 00:00:48.234
Badger faced them and cleared his throat.

12
00:00:48.235 --> 00:00:53.599
"My friends, Toad is truly sorry," said Badger.

13
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.001
"Well, that’s good news," said Mole.

14
00:00:57.002 --> 00:01:02.320
"Toad," said Badger, "I want you to apologize."

15
00:01:02.321 --> 00:01:06.249
Toad looked this way and that. The

16
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:10.136
others waited in silence. Suddenly,

17
00:01:10.137 --> 00:01:13.561
Toad jumped up. "No!

18
00:01:13.562 --> 00:01:18.434
I’m not sorry!" yelled Toad. "I

19
00:01:18.435 --> 00:01:23.256
won’t stop driving! Vroom!" "What?"

20
00:01:23.257 --> 00:01:29.124
shouted Badger. "You promised . . . " Toad

21
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:32.556
pointed at the room. "I

22
00:01:32.557 --> 00:01:35.811
promised in there. You

23
00:01:35.812 --> 00:01:41.969
were so angry," Toad said, "and I felt bad. But

24
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:46.377
out here , I changed my mind."

25
00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:50.420
"I told you, didn’t I?" said Rat to Mole.

26
00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:55.940
"Well," said Badger, "there’s only one thing to do.

27
00:01:55.941 --> 00:01:58.562
You won’t change your ways.

28
00:01:58.563 --> 00:02:04.359
So we’ll stay here until you do!"

29
00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:08.260
Rat, Mole, and Badger grabbed Toad.

30
00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.955
They dragged him upstairs.

31
00:02:10.956 --> 00:02:14.199
They locked him in his bedroom.

32
00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:19.500
"Let me out!" shouted Toad.

